1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,690
(The day after the fireworks festival)

2
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:14,620
Even during the festival,
Sakisaki and Mukai didn't kiss each other.

3
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:20,580
Mukai, just get along with Sakisaki
and look only at her.

4
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:24,550
And yet, why could you...

5
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:28,760
I just want to give up.

6
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,720
Give up on what?

7
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,100
Shino?

8
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,730
Did... Did you see it?

9
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,690
See what?

10
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:52,530
Is something wrong?

11
00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:54,890
It's nothing.

12
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,740
Really?

13
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,700
Oh, does your wound
from yesterday still hurt?

14
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,630
No, really.
Thanks for your concern.

15
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:08,150
Why didn't you kiss yesterday?

16
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:08,800
Huh?

17
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,510
You want me to kiss you?

18
00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:12,220
Not me!

19
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:14,420
I'm talking about Sakisaki.

20
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:16,180
I see.

21
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:23,150
To be honest, some stuff happened
after I left you.

22
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:25,770
Like getting caught by Mirika.

23
00:01:25,770 --> 00:01:27,610
She never learns.

24
00:01:27,610 --> 00:01:30,030
And then, doing stuff with Minase.

25
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:31,610
Doing stuff with Minase?

26
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,320
Did you call me?

27
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:42,910
What did you do with Mukai yesterday?

28
00:01:42,910 --> 00:01:45,130
Huh? About that...

29
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:50,710
What did you do?!

30
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:54,890
Don't tell me,
you got ahead of Sakisaki...

31
00:01:56,090 --> 00:01:58,080
Did you kiss him?

32
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,140
We didn't do that.

33
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:01,306
Shino?

34
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:02,730
Then what did you do?

35
00:02:02,730 --> 00:02:05,520
We held hands.

36
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:11,350
Show me how you held hands.

37
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:12,190
What?

38
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,320
Like this.

39
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,290
That's the way lovers hold hands!

40
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:23,740
What else did you do?
You two did many stuff, right?

41
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:25,420
Well...

42
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:26,910
Show me!

43
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:27,880
Okay!

44
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,090
I laid down on him.

45
00:02:30,090 --> 00:02:32,050
I held her like a princess.

46
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:34,010
And then, we hugged.

47
00:02:40,890 --> 00:02:42,680
Is that all?

48
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:46,090
After that, we just talked.

49
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:50,350
Watched the fireworks together.

50
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:58,250
It was a very special moment for me.

51
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:05,460
Why is it always you?

52
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:09,380
Don't you feel bad for Sakisaki?

53
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,590
Shino...

54
00:03:13,550 --> 00:03:14,890
You fool!

55
00:03:27,090 --> 00:03:31,660
If only Minase wasn't here,
this would've never happened.

56
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:42,900
If only she wasn't here,
Sakisaki would be happy.

57
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:47,770
So I could've given up.

58
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:53,090
Not fair.

59
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:59,710
It's not fair.

60
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:02,970
Minase, you're not fair.

61
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:11,990
I can't delete it.

62
00:04:13,983 --> 00:04:18,153
I wanna let you know when
I have a crush on you! You!

63
00:04:20,114 --> 00:04:23,075
A throbbing development
is a maiden's desire!

64
00:04:23,075 --> 00:04:24,326
Is admiration not enough?

65
00:04:24,326 --> 00:04:26,120
It is not exciting enough!

66
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,998
A beam of love that heals the world

67
00:04:28,998 --> 00:04:31,959
I want to be loved, I want to be in love

68
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,377
Such ambiguous impulse

69
00:04:33,377 --> 00:04:34,712
I miss you! How about you?

70
00:04:34,712 --> 00:04:37,256
Notice my gaze

71
00:04:38,007 --> 00:04:40,926
I see the future where I am with you

72
00:04:40,926 --> 00:04:42,928
My dream is getting bigger

73
00:04:42,928 --> 00:04:46,223
The feelings I have been hiding
just popped out

74
00:04:46,223 --> 00:04:49,435
This heart of mine becomes noisy
when it is just the two of us

75
00:04:49,435 --> 00:04:54,857
Although you won't notice
since you are so dense

76
00:04:54,857 --> 00:05:01,071
I know that I am not the one
you are looking at

77
00:05:01,071 --> 00:05:04,283
Still, I cannot stop wishing for

78
00:05:04,283 --> 00:05:07,870
a love story with you

79
00:05:08,495 --> 00:05:11,707
I want to fall in love dramatically

80
00:05:11,707 --> 00:05:14,585
I want to love you romantically

81
00:05:14,585 --> 00:05:20,507
I want you to take me for real
and fall in love with you

82
00:05:20,507 --> 00:05:23,552
Choose me in a roundabout way

83
00:05:23,552 --> 00:05:26,680
Make me laugh with a happy ending

84
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:29,683
There is a view I want to see with you

85
00:05:29,683 --> 00:05:32,478
I would rather be next to you

86
00:05:32,478 --> 00:05:34,355
Just keep that in mind

87
00:05:47,610 --> 00:05:49,410
What's this?

88
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:58,500
To Miss Saki Saki, congratulations on winning
the giveaway for this set of camping tools.

89
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:00,990
Huh? Really? Wow!

90
00:06:00,990 --> 00:06:03,250
Did you apply for something?

91
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:07,470
I'm not sure, so it might be.

92
00:06:07,470 --> 00:06:08,810
So vague.

93
00:06:08,810 --> 00:06:12,520
There's also coupons for
free access to a camping site.

94
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:15,600
It's valid until this weekend.

95
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,230
Let's go there!

96
00:06:18,970 --> 00:06:24,450
A hundred and thirty thousand
to lure out the guy she likes...

97
00:06:34,570 --> 00:06:36,670
What an amazing view!

98
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:40,330
The weather's great as well.
A perfect day for camping.

99
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:44,230
Let's make more good memories
and get along together!

100
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:45,130
Yeah!

101
00:06:45,650 --> 00:06:47,610
I'll set up the tent.

102
00:06:47,610 --> 00:06:49,100
Leave the cooking to me.

103
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:54,350
I'm so lucky, to win
a giveaway of camping tools.

104
00:06:54,350 --> 00:06:56,310
You? Lucky?

105
00:06:56,750 --> 00:07:01,410
A person who's currently getting
two-timed on is lucky?

106
00:07:01,410 --> 00:07:02,780
Oi! Shinosuke!

107
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:05,740
Some things in this world
are better off left unsaid!

108
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,100
It's your fault for being too carefree.

109
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:14,580
Is this still about the festival?

110
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,170
Well, I couldn't believe
you forgot to kiss him.

111
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:22,710
Are you fine with Minase stealing
Mukai away from you?

112
00:07:23,130 --> 00:07:25,220
They will be fine, maybe...

113
00:07:27,450 --> 00:07:29,830
It's because you're like that.

114
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:32,930
You don't have to worry
about me that much.

115
00:07:33,970 --> 00:07:35,390
Shino, could it be...

116
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:38,350
Do you actually love me?

117
00:07:38,710 --> 00:07:40,350
I'm about to hate you, actually.

118
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:41,570
Please, don't!

119
00:07:42,786 --> 00:07:45,070
Saki, can you please
collect some water?

120
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:47,110
I'll set up the tent in the meantime.

121
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:49,570
Alrighty!

122
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:54,040
You stay here to keep watch so that
Minase doesn't do anything weird.

123
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,850
Shino?

124
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:12,370
If only Sakisaki did it properly,

125
00:08:12,370 --> 00:08:16,210
I wouldn't have to worry so much
about Mukai.

126
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:24,210
Guess who?

127
00:08:25,650 --> 00:08:28,350
Hey, what are you doing, Sakisaki?

128
00:08:28,350 --> 00:08:33,030
Well, you looked so angry.

129
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:37,500
So I thought if I could turn you on,
you wouldn't be angry anymore.

130
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:39,670
That won't happen,
and you made me angry more!

131
00:08:40,050 --> 00:08:43,870
That means you really were angry.

132
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:47,290
I'm not actually angry.

133
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:51,010
Anyway, stop groping my chest!

134
00:08:51,010 --> 00:08:53,720
Sorry, but this actually feels good.

135
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,930
Geez!

136
00:08:56,455 --> 00:08:59,120
They're small,
yet they sure have elasticity.

137
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,980
Stop giving commentary!

138
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:05,650
Don't grope them in silence either!

139
00:09:06,050 --> 00:09:09,860
Do you think I'm really no good?

140
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:13,990
Yeah, I do.
I have no more doubts at this point.

141
00:09:14,950 --> 00:09:16,950
At any rate...

142
00:09:17,370 --> 00:09:19,650
Sorry for worrying you.

143
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:24,380
Then, you should do it properly.

144
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:27,840
Oh, are you actually a tsundere?

145
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,030
Huh? Wait!

146
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:38,680
Come on, stop it.
If you don't, I will...

147
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:43,530
Stop!

148
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,250
Give it a rest already!

149
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:50,230
Forgive me.

150
00:09:52,250 --> 00:09:55,270
As expected, I'm still winning.

151
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:56,740
Stare...

152
00:10:01,070 --> 00:10:04,220
You're always doing dumb things.

153
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:05,670
Sorry.

154
00:10:06,030 --> 00:10:09,410
You need to get serious with Mukai, too!

155
00:10:09,410 --> 00:10:12,780
I actually am, though.

156
00:10:12,780 --> 00:10:16,100
But you let him alone with Minase.

157
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:18,010
What are you thinking?

158
00:10:18,770 --> 00:10:23,850
Well, you know...

159
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:25,980
What?

160
00:10:26,990 --> 00:10:33,340
It looked like you weren't just angry,
you're also worried about something too.

161
00:10:37,350 --> 00:10:38,870
I couldn't leave you be.

162
00:10:39,190 --> 00:10:40,880
Sakisaki?

163
00:10:42,590 --> 00:10:43,930
Well...

164
00:10:43,930 --> 00:10:47,790
See? I'm not as stupid as you think.

165
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:51,250
I can always tell if
something's wrong with you.

166
00:10:57,590 --> 00:11:03,060
Sakisaki, could it be that
you're not serious about Mukai—

167
00:11:06,010 --> 00:11:08,390
It's from Naoya.

168
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,050
Hello?

169
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,570
What's wrong?

170
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:17,760
Saki, something bad happened!

171
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:33,890
Setting up the tent is difficult!

172
00:11:33,890 --> 00:11:35,760
I can't start the fire!

173
00:11:36,190 --> 00:11:37,720
This is ridiculous.

174
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,050
We might have to sleep in the open air.

175
00:11:40,050 --> 00:11:41,930
We won't have anything to eat.

176
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,300
That's bad news.

177
00:11:49,450 --> 00:11:51,270
Seems you're in trouble.

178
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:57,870
It's time for this Super Camping MeTuber
to enter the stage!

179
00:11:57,870 --> 00:11:59,450
Wait for me!

180
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,580
For the tent, you do this,

181
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:07,580
like this,

182
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,820
and it's done.

183
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:12,230
To light up the fire,

184
00:12:12,230 --> 00:12:16,540
you have to gather the small charcoals,
put some newspapers in the center,

185
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,050
and light it up.

186
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:22,140
And for a camping meal...

187
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:23,550
Like this!

188
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:32,810
It's a coincidence to meet you during
our first camping. You're a lifesaver.

189
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:35,050
Praise me more!

190
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:38,400
Wait! Do you really think
this is a coincidence?

191
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,860
Now that you mention it!

192
00:12:41,450 --> 00:12:44,070
Did you follow us again?

193
00:12:44,070 --> 00:12:45,700
Took you long enough.

194
00:12:46,110 --> 00:12:49,920
I already knew that you'd come
camping here today.

195
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:55,550
These camping tools and free coupons that
all of you thought were a giveaway,

196
00:12:55,550 --> 00:12:58,260
were things I bought and sent you myself.

197
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:01,720
Does that mean...

198
00:13:02,730 --> 00:13:05,180
Uh? You're a good person?

199
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:08,060
No, she's probably scheming something.

200
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:09,140
I see.

201
00:13:10,110 --> 00:13:12,450
Why did you do all that, Mirika?

202
00:13:12,450 --> 00:13:14,110
Isn't it obvious?

203
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,860
Because I wanted to go camping
with you, Naoya.

204
00:13:18,930 --> 00:13:21,240
You wouldn't come if I just invited you.

205
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:24,784
You spent so much money just for that?

206
00:13:25,590 --> 00:13:28,170
I get to be with Naoya I love,
surrounded by nature,

207
00:13:28,170 --> 00:13:32,170
eating the food I cook,
and deepening our relationship.

208
00:13:32,630 --> 00:13:35,090
Of course I'm willing to
spend money on the one I love.

209
00:13:37,050 --> 00:13:39,300
She really loves him.

210
00:13:40,110 --> 00:13:41,720
Why?

211
00:13:42,650 --> 00:13:45,260
Even though I rejected you so much.

212
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:49,180
Want some, Saki?

213
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:51,730
Really? With pleasure.

214
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:55,400
Watch out, she drugged me before!

215
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,690
Are you for real?

216
00:13:56,690 --> 00:13:58,450
That did happen.

217
00:13:58,450 --> 00:14:00,940
I didn't put any today.

218
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:02,150
That's so suspicious.

219
00:14:03,070 --> 00:14:05,380
I can make food too!

220
00:14:05,382 --> 00:14:06,602
Nagisa!

221
00:14:08,890 --> 00:14:12,000
We have an ultimate chef on our side.

222
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:16,850
This is pretty good, though.

223
00:14:19,340 --> 00:14:20,550
Huh?

224
00:14:21,470 --> 00:14:23,280
Risa, eat some too.

225
00:14:25,690 --> 00:14:26,930
So delicious!

226
00:14:26,930 --> 00:14:28,510
They're eating normally.

227
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,770
That was delicious!

228
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,450
I love pizza too!

229
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:35,060
I know, but...

230
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:38,570
Nagisa, how's our super delicious
camping meal going?

231
00:14:39,570 --> 00:14:42,110
About that...

232
00:14:43,990 --> 00:14:45,240
It's burnt black!

233
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,570
It's hard to handle the fire.

234
00:14:47,570 --> 00:14:51,540
See? It's not that easy.

235
00:14:52,010 --> 00:14:52,750
Here we go!

236
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:56,080
I made this on the video and
got over 300 thousand views!

237
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:04,050
I made this to celebrate getting 70,000
subscribers, the high-quality paella!

238
00:15:05,510 --> 00:15:07,760
The good old curry!

239
00:15:10,830 --> 00:15:12,410
Camping meals...

240
00:15:12,410 --> 00:15:14,790
Saki, calm down!

241
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:16,710
Our skills are different.

242
00:15:16,710 --> 00:15:20,730
How many camping videos
do you think I've made until now?

243
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,960
I don't mind even if she drugged me.

244
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,910
- Wait!
- Sakisaki!

245
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:33,560
You get to sleep and wake up early,
so it's a good thing!

246
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:34,850
What kind of thinking is that?

247
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:39,440
Mirika my Goddess,
please give me your blessings.

248
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,960
It can't be helped.

249
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:46,170
But only after Naoya eat it first.

250
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:49,710
I made them for him, after all.

251
00:15:49,710 --> 00:15:51,490
Naoya, eat.

252
00:15:53,830 --> 00:15:55,480
Got it.

253
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:09,820
It tastes good.

254
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:14,790
Right?

255
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,630
I can eat now, right?

256
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:21,210
Go ahead.

257
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:22,780
Me too.

258
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:25,240
Good for you, Sis.

259
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:28,760
So good!

260
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,790
Delicious!

261
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,600
You too, Shino.

262
00:16:35,270 --> 00:16:37,390
Yeah, this is good.

263
00:16:37,730 --> 00:16:39,156
Mirika...

264
00:16:40,190 --> 00:16:44,590
Even after all the harsh things
I said to you during the festival,

265
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:48,910
why can you still act so normally?

266
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:52,870
You're starting to like me, aren't you?

267
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,850
What is that bullcrap?

268
00:17:02,850 --> 00:17:07,210
Well, I'm just trying to be objective.

269
00:17:07,210 --> 00:17:10,030
Naoya, say something!

270
00:17:12,990 --> 00:17:14,190
Naoya?

271
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,550
About what she said...

272
00:17:18,810 --> 00:17:20,060
I can't deny that.

273
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:21,270
Hey!

